OL,3,GNEWSACouncil leaders demand #10m
OL,4,Afunding talks with PM
OL,5,
OL,6,FHull City Council leaders have written
OL,7,Fto the prime minister seeking urgent
OL,8,Ftalks over local government funding.
OL,10,FThe letter, to Andy Burnham and other
OL,11,Fsenior cabinet ministers, said
OL,12,Flast-minute changes to the government's
OL,13,FFair Funding 2.0 formula would see the
OL,14,Fcity receive #10m less than it expected
OL,15,Fbased on previous predictions.
OL,17,FCouncil leader Mike Ross said Hull had
OL,18,Fbeen promised more support under the
OL,19,Foriginal plans and argued the city
OL,20,Fcontinued to face significant financial
OL,21,Fpressures.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
