OL,3,GNEWSACouncil leaders demand #10m
OL,4,Afunding talks with PM
OL,5,
OL,6,FA government spokesperson said the
OL,7,Fcouncil would receive #383.6m for
OL,8,F2026/27, rising to #418.8m by 2028/29,
OL,9,Fwhich was an increase of 28.1% compared
OL,10,Fwith the money it received in 2024/25.
